Corporate Leave Policy in India 
In India, corporate leave policies are governed by various labor laws and regulations, which can 
vary based on the type of employment, industry, and state-specific legislation. While there is no 
single, unified leave policy applicable to all corporate entities, certain statutory leaves are 
mandated under Indian labor laws. 
