 Typically, the entitlement is around 15 to 30 days per year, depending on the 
company's policy and the applicable state laws. 
 Probationary employees and contract workers may or may not be eligible for earned 
leave, depending on the company's policies. 
 Planned Leave: Earned leave is typically used for vacations or extended breaks from 
work. Employees often plan their holidays using earned leave. 

Approval: Employees usually need to apply in advance for earned leave, and it needs to 
be approved by their supervisor or HR, depending on company policy. 
